# A smaller stand-in for the shared model, for computers that cannot run qwen3:8b (DECISIONS.md 20).
# Create it under the same name, so nothing else changes:
#   ollama pull qwen3:4b-q4_K_M
#   ollama create qwen3-agents -f contracts/ollama/Modelfile.4b
# This replaces the 8B qwen3-agents if you had it; run the main Modelfile again to switch back.
# Download 2.6 GB; needs about 5 GB of memory with the 16K context. For 8 GB computers and for
# PCs without a graphics card.
# Pinned to the tag with the same chat template as qwen3:8b; plain qwen3:4b now points to a
# thinking-only build. The settings below must match the main Modelfile.
FROM qwen3:4b-q4_K_M
PARAMETER num_ctx 16384
PARAMETER temperature 0
PARAMETER seed 42
